      <div style="padding:0 18px 18px">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e4f2f0;"><span style="flex:none;width:104px;font-size:13px;font-weight:900;color:#1d7a72;letter-spacing:0.08em">料金</span><span style="flex:1;text-align:right;color:#10302b"><span style="font-size:clamp(26px,8vw,32px);font-weight:900;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#10302b">300</span><span style="font-size:15px;font-weight:900;margin-left:2px">万円</span></span></div>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e4f2f0;"><span style="flex:none;width:104px;font-size:13px;font-weight:900;color:#1d7a72;letter-spacing:0.08em">目標粗利</span><span style="flex:1;text-align:right;color:#10302b"><span style="font-size:clamp(26px,8vw,32px);font-weight:900;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#28968d">1,000</span><span style="font-size:15px;font-weight:900;margin-left:2px">万円〜</span></span></div>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e4f2f0;"><span style="flex:none;width:104px;font-size:13px;font-weight:900;color:#1d7a72;letter-spacing:0.08em">年間商談数</span><span style="flex:1;text-align:right;color:#10302b"><span style="font-size:clamp(26px,8vw,32px);font-weight:900;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#10302b">40</span><span style="font-size:15px;font-weight:900;margin-left:2px">件</span></span></div>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 0;"><span style="flex:none;width:104px;font-size:13px;font-weight:900;color:#1d7a72;letter-spacing:0.08em">粗利保証</span><span style="flex:1;text-align:right;color:#10302b"><span style="font-size:clamp(26px,8vw,32px);font-weight:900;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#28968d">600</span><span style="font-size:15px;font-weight:900;margin-left:2px">万円</span></span></div>
        <div style="background:#eff8f6;border:1px solid #b0d7d1;padding:12px 14px;margin-top:14px"><div style="font-size:14.5px;font-weight:900;color:#10302b;line-height:1.7">600万円は<span style="color:#28968d">上限ではなく、下限</span>です。</div><div style="font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;color:#53706c;line-height:1.8;margin-top:4px">1,000万円、2,000万円と、粗利の最大化まで伴走します。創出した粗利はすべて御社の利益になります。</div></div>
      </div>
