        <div style="font-size:12.5px;font-weight:900;color:#1d7a72;letter-spacing:0.14em;padding:2px 0 12px;border-top:1px solid #e4f2f0">その流れ</div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
        <div style="background:#fbfefd;border:1px solid #cfe4e1;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(16,48,43,0.08)"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:10px 0 0"><span style="background:#1d7a72;color:#fbfefd;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.14em;padding:4px 15px;border-radius:3px">STEP 1</span></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:11px 14px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e4f2f0"><img src="assets/step/step1.jpg" alt="商材のヒアリング" style="flex:none;width:108px;height:74px;border-radius:4px;object-fit:cover;display:block"><span style="flex:1;min-width:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:900;color:#10302b;line-height:1.6">商材をヒアリングし、審査</span></div><div style="padding:11px 14px 14px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500;color:#53706c;line-height:1.85">対象業種・粗利率・提供体制を確認します。</div></div>
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:-2px 0"><span style="width:0;height:0;border-left:8px solid transparent;border-right:8px solid transparent;border-top:9px solid #b0cdc9;display:block"></span></div>
        <div style="background:#fbfefd;border:1px solid #cfe4e1;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(16,48,43,0.08)"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:10px 0 0"><span style="background:#1d7a72;color:#fbfefd;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.14em;padding:4px 15px;border-radius:3px">STEP 2</span></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:11px 14px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e4f2f0"><div style="flex:none;width:108px;height:74px;border:2px dashed #a4d0ca;border-radius:4px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(115deg,#eff8f6 0 6px,#e4f2f0 6px 12px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><span style="font-size:10.5px;font-weight:900;color:#6d8d89;letter-spacing:0.06em">写真</span></div><span style="flex:1;min-width:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:900;color:#10302b;line-height:1.6">18,000社から決裁者を抽出</span></div><div style="padding:11px 14px 14px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500;color:#53706c;line-height:1.85">御社の商材にニーズがあるかを、一社ずつ確認します。</div></div>
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:-2px 0"><span style="width:0;height:0;border-left:8px solid transparent;border-right:8px solid transparent;border-top:9px solid #b0cdc9;display:block"></span></div>
        <div style="background:#fbfefd;border:1px solid #cfe4e1;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(16,48,43,0.08)"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:10px 0 0"><span style="background:#1d7a72;color:#fbfefd;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.14em;padding:4px 15px;border-radius:3px">STEP 3</span></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:11px 14px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e4f2f0"><div style="flex:none;width:108px;height:74px;border:2px dashed #a4d0ca;border-radius:4px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(115deg,#eff8f6 0 6px,#e4f2f0 6px 12px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><span style="font-size:10.5px;font-weight:900;color:#6d8d89;letter-spacing:0.06em">写真</span></div><span style="flex:1;min-width:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:900;color:#10302b;line-height:1.6">紹介として商談をセット</span></div><div style="padding:11px 14px 14px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500;color:#53706c;line-height:1.85">初回から具体的な話が進む状態でお繋ぎします。</div></div>
