            <div style="position:relative;text-align:center;font-size:15.5px;font-weight:900;color:#1d7a72;line-height:1.65;min-height:52px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px"><span>財務・節税に課題を抱える<br>経営者との接点づくり</span></div>
